<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of Aug 23, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Aug 23   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
